{"3155010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Necrosis: Dawn of Dread", "steam_appid": 3155010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE SURVIVAL HORROR COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/1935953a8ea87050c8d7aa77a42a1c11.poster.avif?t=1783721649\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/1935953a8ea87050c8d7aa77a42a1c11.webm?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/1935953a8ea87050c8d7aa77a42a1c11.mp4?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ROLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/14127a83e85218e556bde2af61ff1d5d.poster.avif?t=1783721649\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/14127a83e85218e556bde2af61ff1d5d.webm?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/14127a83e85218e556bde2af61ff1d5d.mp4?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL SQUAD BASED CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necrosis: Dawn of Dread is a co-op survival horror game built around tension, teamwork, and limited resources,</strong> <strong>inspired by classic survival horror design from the late 90s and early 2000s.</strong><br><br><br> Every encounter requires positioning, coordination, and careful use of ammo and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on how well your team works together. Each character has unique strengths and weaknesses and you will have to cover each others weaknesses to succeed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DELIBERATE, TACTICAL GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighty movement designed for survival horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited ammo forces meaningful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are dangerous and punishing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYSTEM-DRIVEN COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun enemies to create opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute weakened zombies to conserve resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities with teammates for maximum effect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPLAYABLE MISSIONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large, multi-step levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized encounters and item locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes and strategies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR PLAYERS WHO WANT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO THIS GAME IS FOR:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll enjoy Necrosis if you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Methodical gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working closely with teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing limited resources under pressure<br><br><br><br><strong>MAJOR UPDATE – FREE DLC AVAILABLE NOW</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Mission (Oil Rig)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>Asymmetric Mission (Sewer)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>Defense Mode (Last Stand)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 New Playable Characters</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/2143f017910d00973011bcda9775f2c3.poster.avif?t=1783721649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/2143f017910d00973011bcda9775f2c3.webm?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/2143f017910d00973011bcda9775f2c3.mp4?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEWER – ASYMMETRIC MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player becomes <strong>mission control</strong>, guiding the team through a dangerous underground system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor teammates through <strong>security cameras</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger <strong>traps</strong> and control <strong>doors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent deadly mistakes in real time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LAST STAND – DEFENSE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your ground against escalating waves of enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure <strong>supply trucks</strong> to earn resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend on <strong>weapons, ammo, and NPC reinforcements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy as the pressure builds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR ROLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple characters, each built for a different playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> – High damage and frontline power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout</strong> – Mobility, utility, and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medic</strong> – Support your team and keep everyone alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team and <strong>work together to survive</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.poster.avif?t=1783721649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.webm?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/797fa701831d25d58e34f67c0af86ffc.mp4?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op survival horror for up to 4<strong> players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large, replayable levels</strong> with randomized elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management</strong> – every bullet matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving under pressure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique character abilities and team synergy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions or DRM</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU MAKE IT OUT ALIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different.<br>Every decision matters.<br>Not everyone makes it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS NECROSIS: DAWN OF DREAD?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense, brutal first-person co-op survival horror experience inspired by classic 90s-era design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to four players to scavenge supplies, survive relentless encounters, and solve puzzles across <strong>17 unique missions</strong> overrun by the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a desperate fight for survival built around <strong>interdependence, inventory management, and careful pacing</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, limited resources, and constant pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage ammo carefully and choose your shots wisely.<br>Reckless play will get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an arcade shooter.<br>Every bullet matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge observation and deduction under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>12 Survivors + Many Unlockable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique role, ability, and weapon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee finishers, stuns, healing, buffs, debuffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden unlockable characters with new strategies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Large Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 environments inspired by survival horror classics, each designed for multiple runs with new outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy placement, items, and some puzzles change every session. No two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in for a quick run or survive a full session with your squad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatcher queue with VOIP and text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mode with AI teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, unlockables, and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing free content updates</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO DRM. NO MICROTRANSACTIONS. NO NONSENSE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just buy the game and play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR SURVIVAL HORROR FANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed independently with a focus on <strong>player-first design</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No corporate interference.<br>No shortcuts.<br>Just uncompromising co-op survival horror.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE SURVIVAL HORROR COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/1935953a8ea87050c8d7aa77a42a1c11.poster.avif?t=1783721649\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/extras/1935953a8ea87050c8d7aa77a42a1c11.webm?t=1783721649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item