ng>Terrifying Co-op Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large, unpredictable environments filled with relentless enemies, limited resources, and constant pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage ammo carefully and choose your shots wisely.<br>Reckless play will get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an arcade shooter.<br>Every bullet matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve layered, interactive puzzles that challenge observation and deduction under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>12 Survivors + Many Unlockable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique role, ability, and weapon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee finishers, stuns, healing, buffs, debuffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden unlockable characters with new strategies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Large Replayable Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 environments inspired by survival horror classics, each designed for multiple runs with new outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy placement, items, and some puzzles change every session. No two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in for a quick run or survive a full session with your squad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatcher queue with VOIP and text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mode with AI teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, unlockables, and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing free content updates</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO DRM. NO MICROTRANSACTIONS. NO NONSENSE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just buy the game and play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR SURVIVAL HORROR FANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed independently with a focus on <strong>player-first design</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No corporate interference.<br>No shortcuts.<br>Just uncompromising co-op survival horror.</p>", "short_description": "Necrosis: Dawn of Dread is a full-length co-op survival horror experience inspired by the golden age of zombies. 15+ hours of missions, vehicles, puzzles, with many playable survivors await across a world consumed by the dead. No microtransactions, no shortcuts: just pure survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/c2e163497a1293ecafa24bab854489d7751a7526/header.jpg?t=1783721649", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/efe4322479d403b3c35d741fe93f9305dd0930b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783721649", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155010/efe4322479d403b3c35d741fe93f9305dd0930b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783721649", "website": "https://www.necrosisdawnofdread.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD 2.5 GHz or superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any DirectX 11 or 12 compatible card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Mike Schroder", "Swole Soft